# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hazard-tram (test/README.md): the Hazard Course end tram in t0a0d,
# test/routes/hazard.route's ride (the lines after `stats t0a0d`, with
# shots): func_tracktrain *23 (trainingtrain) waits on path_track train1
# (184 -1076 -104, height 40: origin 184 -1076 -64, yaw 90). From the
# platform (shot `platform`, looking south down the track at the tram)
# the player boards it, takes the controls (+use: `player: train N
# controls`, the HUD's train indicator at stop), pushes forward four
# times (50, 100, 150, 200 u/s, HLSDK CFuncTrackTrain::Use USE_SET) and
# rides south to the dead end (GoldSrc: fixture physics-movetypes/
# P-tracktrain t0a0d `drive`: 200 u/s, 100 u every 0.5 s, stop at
# 184 -2506 -64, the rider at the train's origin + 36.03 u). Shots
# `aboard` (on the tram at train1, looking down at its deck), `moving-1`
# .. `moving-3` (along the ride, looking ahead and down at the deck), `end`
# (at the dead end).
# scene-window: hazard t0a0d t0a0d-walked
startmap t0a0d
waitmap t0a0d 60
god 1
setpos 176 -808 -23 10 270
wait 1
stats begin
shot platform
setpos 184 -1076 -27 30 270
wait 0.5
stats aboard
shot aboard
+use
wait 0.1
-use
wait 0.2
+forward
wait 0.1
-forward
wait 0.2
+forward
wait 0.1
-forward
wait 0.2
+forward
wait 0.1
-forward
wait 0.2
+forward
wait 0.1
-forward
wait 1
stats moving-1
shot moving-1
waitnear 184 -1800 -28 120 10
shot moving-2
waitnear 184 -2300 -28 120 10
shot moving-3
waitnear 184 -2506 -28 4 15
wait 0.5
shot end
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
